  "html": "<html><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=iso-8859-1\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"Parl_No\" content=\"1\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"Sess_No\" content=\"1\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"Vol_No\" content=\"24\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"Sit_No\" content=\"9\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"Sit_Date\" content=\"1965-12-22\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"Sect_Name\" content=\"BILLS\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"Title\" content=\"CONSTITUTION (AMENDMENT) BILL\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"MP_Speak\" content=\"Mr Lee Kuan Yew (Prime Minister); Mr A. P. Rajah (Mr Speaker);\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"Start_Col\" content=\"430\">\r\n\r\n<meta name=\"End_Col\" content=\"451\">\r\n\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" bordercolor=\"#000000\"><tr><td>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">Parliament No:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">1</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">Session No:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">1</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">Volume No:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">24</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">Sitting No:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">9</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">Sitting Date:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">22-12-1965</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">Section Name:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">BILLS</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">Title:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">CONSTITUTION (AMENDMENT) BILL</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">MPs Speaking:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">Mr Lee Kuan Yew (Prime Minister); Mr A. P. Rajah (Mr Speaker);</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n</table></td></tr>\r\n\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<!-- Mr A. P. Rajah (Mr Speaker) -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Mr Speaker:</b> The procedure that was adopted on the Second\r\n\r\nReading will again he adopted on this Bill. The  Clerk\r\n\r\nwill ring the Division Bells.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The house divided: Ayes, 36; Absent, 15.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Ayes.              Absent.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nA. Rahim Ishak      Bani, S.T\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBarker, E. W.       Chan Sun Wing\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBuang bin           Chia Thye Poh\r\n\r\n Omar Junid\r\n\r\n                    Chio Cheng Thun\r\n\r\nChan Chee Seng\r\n\r\n                    Fong Kim Heng\r\n\r\nChan Choy Siong,\r\n\r\n Madam.             Goh Keng Swee\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nChow Chiok Hock     Koo Young\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFong Sip Chee       Kow Kee Seng\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGonzales, R.A       Lee Tee Tong\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGovindaswamy, P.    Lim Huan Boon\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHo Cheng Choon      Loh Miaw Gong,\r\n\r\n                     Miss\r\n\r\nHo See Beng\r\n\r\n                    Ong Lian Teng\r\n\r\nJek Yeun Thong\r\n\r\n                    Poh Ber Liak\r\n\r\nLee Khoon Choy\r\n\r\n                    Tan Cheng Tong\r\n\r\nLee Kuan Yew\r\n\r\n                    Wong Soon Fong\r\n\r\nLee Teck Him\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLim Cheng Lock\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLim Kim San\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLingam, S. V\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMahmud Awang\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMohd. Ariff\r\n\r\n bin Suradi\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNair, Mrs. Devan\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNg Kah Ting\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNg Yeow Chong\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOng Pang Boon\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOthman bin Wok,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRahamat bin Kenap,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRajaratnam, S.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRajoo, S.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRodrigues, Bernard.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSia Kah Hui\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSim Boon Woo\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTeong Eng Siong\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nToh Chin Chye.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWee Toon Boon\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYaacob bin\r\n\r\n Mohamad Al-Haj\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYong Nyuk Lin\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br><!-- Mr A. P. Rajah (Mr Speaker) -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Mr Speaker:</b> I hereby declare that the Third Reading of\r\n\r\nthe   Bill  has  been  carried  in  accordance  with   the\r\n\r\nprovisions of Article 90 of the Constitution of the  State\r\n\r\nof Singapore.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bill accordingly read a Third time and passed.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n</body></html>",
